{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20267m50RfnhSZ1793590357.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國佛羅里達州發生墜機事故，機上9人全部喪生。英國廣播公司報道，事發現場距離美國總統特朗普的海湖莊園大約14公里。</p><p></p><p>事發於當地星期日下午1時左右，涉事商用中型噴射機從得州飛往巴哈馬途中失事。有行車記錄儀拍攝到該飛機急墜，撞落一條主要公路附近後爆炸，燃起巨大火球。暫時未知地面有沒有人傷亡，當局正調查事故原因。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.US.CRASH-0830_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026uhXp0JKoKt1793586307.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>有報道指，飛機失事前幾分鐘機師向航空交通管制員表示遇到氣流，又指機身有輕微結冰狀況，不久後就表示飛機急墜，並且緊急求救。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T04:40:50.392180+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":215,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T01:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T09:19:57.346252+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T04:38:09.270756+00:00","content_hash":"44ceadd2e010f593a216ed5ee6bb266f14db2f99ffdb8a14c5c170c6dcf0e927","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}